{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DIESELDOME: Oil &amp; Blood is an FPS with <strong>movement shooter</strong> and <strong>survivors-like</strong> mechanics. In every run, you will create absurdly <strong>powerful builds</strong> against <strong>hordes of enemies</strong> while facing the judgment of the crowd. Prepare to shed some blood in an original Roman-punk universe!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAME-BREAKING BUILDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354640/extras/39bd8e65104046f6b7308e321ef0348f.poster.avif?t=1771931820\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354640/extras/39bd8e65104046f6b7308e321ef0348f.webm?t=1771931820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be a petrol-powered berserker, shooting tens of homing bullets that explode, or a V8-powered auto-crossbow sniper that wall runs and slides their way through the hordes?</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different playable characters, each with unique weapons, abilities, and <strong>progression trees.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 70 unique <strong>game-changing perks</strong> that can be synergized to devastate the Dome.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WIN THE CROWD, RULE THE DOME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354640/extras/bad5e142c3dfb3fd6faa4937580b6d49.poster.avif?t=1771931820\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354640/extras/bad5e142c3dfb3fd6faa4937580b6d49.webm?t=1771931820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The crowd itself determines your fate in the DIESELDOME. While facing warriors warped by the Empire, utilize the combo system to impress the crowd and level up.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new skill trees, maps, and passive skills while taking <strong>randomly generated bets.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter <strong>randomized events</strong> and goals, making every match a fresh, unique challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face over 10 abominations and <strong>bloodthirsty bosses</strong> with unique move sets. They say Caesar himself awaits those who become the ultimate gladiator.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PARKOUR OR PERISH</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354640/extras/b55dc237ddbc390e5e25809e78cf03a9.poster.avif?t=1771931820\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354640/extras/b55dc237ddbc390e5e25809e78cf03a9.webm?t=1771931820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When in Rome, parkour like the Romans do. Thanks to modern Imperial technology, your body is an unstoppable V8-powered engine of flesh!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Parkour your way to glory by <strong>wall-running, sliding, grapple-hooking, gliding, and more.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each run, <strong>the arena shifts</strong> as its machinery and platforms reconfigure into new challenges. If you\u2019ve got the skill, you can use them to traverse the Dome like an eagle!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2354640?t=1771931820","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354640/a8493b0e2516cd280fcdfab896c5b8accc4d5b96/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771931820","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354640/8028628584c96ce67f1e349c100c72c121c41388/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771931820","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354640/8028628584c96ce67f1e349c100c72c121c41388/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771931820","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"DieselDome contains extreme graphic violence including dismemberment, gore, and blood."},"demos":[{"appid":3249480,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DIESELDOME: Oil &amp; Blood is an FPS with <strong>movement shooter</strong> and <strong>survivors-like</strong> mechanics. In every run, you will create absurdly <strong>powerful builds</strong> against <strong>hordes of enemies</strong> while facing the judgment of the crowd. Prepare to shed some blood in an original Roman-punk universe!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAME-BREAKING BUILDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354640/extras/39bd8e65104046f6b7308e321ef0348f.poster.avif?t=1771931820\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354640/extras/39bd8e65104046f6b7308e321ef0348f.webm?t=1771931820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be a petrol-powered berserker, shooting tens of homing bullets that explode, or a V8-powered auto-crossbow sniper that wall runs and slides their way through the hordes?</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different playable characters, each with unique weapons, abilities, and <strong>progression trees.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 70 unique <strong>game-changing perks</strong> that can be synergized to devastate the Dome.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WIN THE CROWD, RULE THE DOME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354640/extras/bad5e142c3dfb3fd6faa4937580b6d49.poster.avif?t=1771931820\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354640/extras/bad5e142c3dfb3fd6faa4937580b6d49.webm?t=1771931820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The crowd itself determines your fate in the DIESELDOME. While facing warriors warped by the Empire, utilize the combo system to impress the crowd and level up.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new skill trees, maps, and passive skills while taking <strong>randomly generated bets.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter <strong>randomized events</strong> and goals, making every match a fresh, unique challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face over 10 abominations and <strong>bloodthirsty bosses</strong> with unique move sets. They say Caesar himself awaits those who become the ultimate gladiator.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PARKOUR OR PERISH</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354640/extras/b55dc237ddbc390e5e25809e78cf03a9.poster.avif?t=1771931820\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354640/extras/b55dc237ddbc390e5e25809e78cf03a9.webm?t=1771931820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When in Rome, parkour like the Romans do. Thanks to modern Imperial technology, your body is an unstoppable V8-powered engine of flesh!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Parkour your way to glory by <strong>wall-running, sliding, grapple-hooking, gliding, and more.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each run, <strong>the arena shifts</strong> as its machinery and platforms reconfigure into new challenges. If you\u2019ve got the skill, you can use them to traverse the Dome like an eagle!</p></li></ul>","developers":["GHST Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354640/07ef62d81e72bfefb422e18fdaf1f33c49dabda0/header.jpg?t=1771931820","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2354640/771774/5988a7a8556e8b428a97e0e7a2103d2dee6f7b5b/1750910457/dash_av1.mpd?t=1728928349","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2354640/771774/5988a7a8556e8b428a97e0e7a2103d2dee6f7b5b/1750910457/dash_h264.mpd?t=1728928349","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2354640/771774/5988a7a8556e8b428a97e0e7a2103d2dee6f7b5b/1750910457/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1728928349","id":257065059,"name":"DIESELDOME: Oil & Blood Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257065059/32fea4da5dbbec70e8a4cf9f3cee4920d98d204d/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1728928349"}],"name":"DIESELDOME: Oil & Blood","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows\u00ae 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.50 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 